# Large build artifacts. Tools that enumerate untracked files (e.g. the
# Codex desktop app) run git over them; models.zip is ~36 GB, which grew
# those git subprocesses to 8-16 GB of RAM and starved other services on
# the build host. models/ is already ignored above; these cover the large
# artifacts that live outside it.
models.zip
*.safetensors
*.gguf
